  "question": {
    "text": "If <math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </msqrt> <mo>−</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msqrt> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> <mi>x</mi> </mfrac> <mo>,</mo></mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow> </mfrac> <mo>,</mo></mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is continuous in <math> <mrow> <mrow><mo>[</mo> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mo>],</mo></mrow> </mrow> </math> then the value of <math> <mi>a</mi> </math> is"
  },
